      data:
        initialized: 1
        wait: 1
        lines:
        - The temple of the golden shield! Our hero grabs the bow, there, on the table.
        - Then the orcs come. Stay by the girl's cage, shoot them all, and don't let them touch you!
        - 'Free the girl from the cage: only she can take down the force field.'
        - Then take the shield. {Action!}
        translate: 1
        maxWaitForDirector: 3
